","name":"鹿狼山","category":"nature","address":"山地（非火山性）景観 / 非火山性弧峰","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"07561","municipality_pref":"福島県","municipality_name":"新地町","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid","resource_code":"205"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[140.86143493652344,37.86165237426758]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"tourism_resources","name":"五社檀","category":"nature","address":"山地（非火山性）景観 / 非火山性弧峰","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"07561","municipality_pref":"福島県","municipality_name":"新地町","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid","resource_code":"205"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[140.86195373535156,37.879886627197266]}}],"display_comment_original":"新地町周辺には、近世村の記憶として駒ヶ嶺村、今泉村、大戸浜村などの旧村名が見える。 この地域には史跡や遺跡、城跡や陣屋跡、寺社や信仰の場に関わる場所が見え、駒ヶ嶺城跡、谷地小屋城跡、三貫地遺跡のような地点が探索の入口になる。 現地では史跡説明板、駒ヶ嶺村、今泉村ゆかりの旧境石標や村の歴史案内板が手がかりになりそうだ。さらに水辺の由緒を示す歴史案内板も見つかるかもしれない。","story_enrichment":{"samurai_priority_people":[],"notable_people":["遠藤新","高野孟矩","横山孝雄"],"honorary_citizens":[],"tourism_landmarks":["釣師浜海水浴場","鹿狼山","観海堂","右近清水","真弓清水","いっぱい清水","新地貝塚","三貫地貝塚"],"specialties":[],"food_culture":[],"historical_domains":[],"heian_place_names":[],"japan_search_support":[],"enrichment_sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%96%B0%E5%9C%B0%E7%94%BA","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q2859562","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q16908312","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q18054942"],"enrichment_errors":[],"wikipedia_title":"新地町","wikipedia_revision_id":"107550598","wikidata_qid":"Q1205416","wikipedia_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%96%B0%E5%9C%B0%E7%94%BA","japan_search_query_url":"","status":"wikipedia_ok"}}